Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 08:48:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make career-ops work as an installed Claude Code plugin

Keep user data out of the plugin cache (default ~/career-ops), tell the
skill to install npm deps and read AGENTS.md in plugin installs, and skip
the self-updater there since /plugin handles updates.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q163nntWKTcJXVLR5y449X
